lignment survives reloads. Type check (tsc) passes with no errors.\",\n  \"files_changed\": [\n    \"client/src/lib/types.ts\",\n    \"client/src/lib/editor-context.tsx\",\n    \"client/src/components/editor/Canvas/OverlayDocument.tsx\",\n    \"client/src/components/editor/LayerPanel.tsx\",\n    \"client/src/hooks/useAutoSave.ts\",\n    \"client/src/hooks/useManualSave.ts\",\n    \"client/src/hooks/useExport.ts\",\n    \"client/src/components/editor/PDFUploader.tsx\",\n    \"shared/schema.ts\"\n  ],\n  \"commands_run\": [\n    \"npx tsc --noEmit -p tsconfig.json\",\n    \"git diff --stat -- client shared\"\n  ],\n  \"tests_run\": [],\n  \"test_results\": [\n    {\n      \"command\": \"npx tsc --noEmit -p tsconfig.json\",\n      \"exit_code\": 0,\n      \"passed\": true,\n      \"output\": \"no diagnostics\"\n    }\n  ],\n  \"criteria_addressed\": [\n    \"c1: DocumentState in client/src/lib/types.ts now has overlayOffset: { x: number; y: number }\",\n    \"c2: EditorAction includes { type: 'SET_OVERLAY_OFFSET'; payload: { x: number; y: number } }\",\n    \"c3: initialDocumentState in client/src/lib/editor-context.tsx defines overlayOffset: { x: 0, y: 0 }\",\n    \"c4: OverlayDocument applies transform translate(overlayOffset.x * uiState.scale, overlayOffset.y * uiState.scale)\",\n    \"c5: LayerPanel renders X/Y numeric inputs, four nudge buttons and a Reset button, only when an overlay document is present\",\n    \"c6: npx tsc --noEmit -p tsconfig.json exits 0 with no errors\"\n  ],\n  \"known_gaps\": [\n    \"No automated test added: the repository has no test runner (no vitest/jest dependency, no test files); only the 'check' (tsc) script exists.\",\n    \"The offset applies to all pages uniformly; per-page alignment is not supported.\",\n    \"Only translation is supported, not rotation or independent scaling of the overlay.\",\n    \"The nudge step of 1 unscaled unit is a sub-pixel shift at low zoom levels.\"\n  ],\n  \"risky_areas\": [\n    \"Persistence changes touch files outside the plan (shared/schema.ts, useAutoSave, useManualSave, useExport, PDFUploader); each is an additive optional field mirroring overlayOpacity.\",\n    \"The documentState memo dependency array in editor-context.tsx had to be extended; missing it would have frozen the overlay position on screen.\",\n    \"The clamp to +/-CANVAS_BASE_WIDTH (600) is a judgement call and silently limits extreme offsets.\"\n  ],\n  \"verification_notes\": \"Serena MCP tools were not available in this runtime, so exploration used grep and file reads (fallback noted per the search-tool policy). Confirmed the DocumentState/EditorAction shape and the SET_OVERLAY_OPACITY precedent, initialDocumentState plus the reducer switch and the memoized documentState selector and its dependency array, OverlayDocument's <Page width={CANVAS_BASE_WIDTH} scale={uiState.scale}> (which fixes the offset unit as unscaled canvas units), and LayerPanel's merged docState/uiState 'state' object with its existing Button/Input/Label imports. Grepped every overlayOpacity reference across client, server and shared to map the blast radius of the new field and locate all persistence sites; IMPORT_PROJECT spreads its payload, so restoring a saved offset needs no extra code. No symbols were renamed or deleted. Post-edit type check exited 0.\"\n}\n```","ttft_ms":4034,"type":"result","duration_ms":331971,"uuid":"168643dc-a5b5-46b5-bc2d-a2e98738133a","ttft_stream_ms":3427,"time_to_request_ms":1666,"first_content_frame_ms":3428,"queued_turn_count":0,"result_index":0}
